OL,3,AZelensky says Russia has widened
OL,4,Aattacks to hit Ukraine's data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky says
OL,7,FRussia has widened its attacks to
OL,8,Ftarget Ukraine's data centres and
OL,9,Finternet providers, seeking to cause
OL,10,Fmaximum disruption for ordinary people.
OL,12,F"All this affects people's ability to
OL,13,Fstay connected, study, work," he said.
OL,15,FOn Friday a Russian drone hit a
OL,16,Fbusiness centre in the capital Kyiv,
OL,17,Fkilling four people and damaging a data
OL,18,Fcentre. A separate attack killed a
OL,19,F14-year-old boy. Israel's foreign
OL,20,Fministry said the teenager was an
OL,21,FIsraeli citizen.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
